or/anchor-term/anchor-term.js` as an **adapter** over `new window.Terminal(...)`, preserving the same `window.AnchorTerm.mount` API, gates, discoverâ†’adopt panel, and beforeunload reap.\n- Added a traversal-safe `/vendor/xterm/` static route plus includes (xterm loaded before anchor-term).\n- The backend (`rnd_terminal.py` + SSE/term endpoints) was **byte-unchanged**, verified via an empty git diff.\n- Orchestrator-run gate result: **394 passed** (the figure was truncated in the source â€” stated as \"394 passed, 1 sâ€¦\").\n\n**Member documents grounding these claims**\n- Anchor R&D Surface v2 â€” Master Plan (frozen design)\n- Anchor R&D Surface v2 â€” Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready)\n- Anchor R&D Surface v2 â€” Execution Log\n\n---\n\nOne note on honesty: the gate's pass count in the final anchor is cut off mid-sentence (\"394 passed, 1 sâ€¦\"), so I've reported the 394 figure and flagged the truncation rather than guessing the rest."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":55553,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0e63a42-e0ea-4ff2-b361-a1a58c16d892","uuid":"874e465b-4f0d-4e28-a5b3-48ddefaf5bbe","request_id":"req_011Cc52tErhNNsbC9bDd4kJr"}
